flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> hydrate[hydrate_context<br/>注入 user_id / thread_id / ToolContext]
    hydrate --> classify[classify_intent<br/>LLM 结构化识别意图]
    classify --> route{route_intent}

    route -->|faq| faq[faq_node<br/>RAG 检索 + 生成答案]
    route -->|order| order[order_agent<br/>ReAct + 只读查询工具]
    route -->|after_sale| afterSale[after_sale_subgraph<br/>售后子图]
    route -->|低置信度/异常| fallback[fallback_node<br/>澄清]

    faq --> finalize[finalize_response<br/>整理 answer / sources / tool_events]
    order --> finalize
    afterSale --> finalize
    fallback --> finalize

    finalize --> persist[update_thread<br/>更新线程状态和 last_message]
    persist --> END([END])